### 1.3 Read all canonical documentation and key contracts

Inspect at least the current versions of:

- `README.md`
- the master Design System Bible;
- `docs/implementation-roadmap.md`;
- repository baseline audit and subsequent delivery reports;
- token/theme research, ADRs, token pipeline, token source plan, token dictionary and theme contract;
- component API & behavior Bible, component manifest, API contract, state/keyboard matrices;
